{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Daisy Music Player 是一款把手機變成復古點擊輪音樂播放器的 App，適合喜歡本地音樂收藏、重視專注聆聽體驗的使用者。它原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，提供以 Bauhaus 風格配色呈現的實體感操作介面。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-265.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>旋鈕操控回歸音樂本質</h2>\n<p>透過旋轉輪盤操控播放，滑動時有近似實體按鍵的回饋感，並可自由切換由極簡黑白到 Bauhaus 原色的配色。App 會讀取本機檔案、播放清單與專輯，不加入演算法推薦、通知或社交動態，讓你只專注眼前音樂；介面亦保持固定視角，避免陀螺儀造成漂移。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-282-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-283-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-284-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-285-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-286-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-287-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Daisy Music Player</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/daisy-music-player/id6762565295?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T06:23:53.320010+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:08:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:58.059563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:17:24.824532+00:00","content_hash":"f15ed0a7771f7f4c98471a00e8369ce27341e275cbb703e5da865e10acf00905","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}